  "problem": "What is the slope $m$ of the line $\\overset{\u2194}{AB}?$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $m\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
